OL,5,G0306FOutlook
OL,6,     GNigerian artist Mama Nike was in
OL,7,     Gan unhappy polygamous marriage,
OL,8,     Gbut the success of her work in
OL,9,     Gpopularising traditional Nigerian
OL,10,     Gtextiles enabled her to leave.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 1944, as World War II was
OL,13,     Gdrawing to a close, the Mexican
OL,14,     Glove song Besame Mucho crossed
OL,15,     Gthe Atlantic and became one of
OL,16,     Gthe most recognisable melodies of
OL,17,     Gthe post-war era.
